翻译一下：to set the columnName using setColumnName?

To set columnName using setColumnName, you need to first instantiate a object of the class which has the setColumnName method. Then, you can call the setColumnName method on that object and pass the desired value for columnName as an argument. Here is an example in Java:
// Instantiate the object of class
SomeClass obj = new SomeClass();

// Call setColumnName method and pass the desired value for columnName
obj.setColumnName(“desiredColumnName”);
Replace “SomeClass” with the actual name of the class you are working with, and “desiredColumnName” with the actual value you want to set for the columnName.

